        "text": "The outside-view base rate is the 12-month mean employment change of 12.3 thousand. Momentum is mildly stronger: the latest trend increase was 20.2 thousand and four of the latest five seasonally adjusted changes were positive. Against that, falling vacancies argue against extrapolating May's 40.3 thousand gain."
